// Critical Chapter 5 localization. Keep the visible graph titles short; the detail belongs in the three labeled lines.
quest.7A11C0DE15000001.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f After Greybridge, Nessa needs a machine understood after its builder leaves. Mirelle needs a ritual that does not rely on one keeper.",
  "&fElias needs a ledger that says who can safely use what.",
  "&fChoose any three specialty projects. The other five remain open choices, not a hidden eight-quest checklist.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Work may be solo or shared. Record your own result and failure, or have another player demonstrate the service."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000001.quest_subtitle: "Choose any three specialties"
quest.7A11C0DE15000001.title: "&6&lWORK TOGETHER"

quest.7A11C0DE15000002.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Nessa's Greybridge press jammed because nobody marked the order of operations. She wants a small service another person can restart without guessing.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Workshop] [Technical] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 4 Create Andesite Alloys for inspection; they are not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one repeatable machine service.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Leave a labelled service card naming inputs, order, output, restart point, and one failure or maintenance note.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may repeat the service; solo players sign the test with the observed result or failure."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000002.quest_subtitle: "[Workshop] [Technical] · make a machine teachable"
quest.7A11C0DE15000002.title: "&6ENGINEER"

quest.7A11C0DE15000003.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Mirelle Voss translated a Greybridge ward from memory and reversed one line. The ward held, but it held the wrong doorway. She needs a method with a visible first step.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Magic] [Research] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 4 Arcane Essences for inspection; they are not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one repeatable spell-preparation step.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Leave a safe preparation card naming the first step, materials, expected result, and one limit or failure warning.",
  "&fStandard:&7 A partner may reproduce the step; solo players sign the test with the observed result or failure."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000003.quest_subtitle: "[Magic] [Research] · make one spell step teachable"
quest.7A11C0DE15000003.title: "&dARCANIST"

quest.7A11C0DE15000004.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Elias Rook once called a night guest by the wrong title at Greybridge. The insult became a security problem.",
  "&fHe now asks for one clear sign that tells strangers what a threshold means.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Magic] [Faction] [Social]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 1 Vampire Fang for inspection; it is not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one Blood or faction-facing procedure.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Publish one threshold sign or procedure card with the welcome rule, boundary, response, and escalation contact.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may follow the procedure; solo players sign the test with the observed result or failure."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000004.quest_subtitle: "[Magic] [Faction] [Social] · translate one night custom"
quest.7A11C0DE15000004.title: "&4NIGHT SPECIALIST"

quest.7A11C0DE15000005.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Nessa's Greybridge courier arrived with a working vehicle and no safe place to land. The first useful aeronautics contribution is a visible, low-tier landing site.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Build] [Workshop] [Route] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 16 Scaffolding for inspection; it is not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test a safe vehicle-site procedure.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Mark one low-tier landing site with an approach, parking or tie-down point, safety boundary, and a written arrival test.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may inspect the test; solo players sign the result or failure. Players who want the later Wing project may pursue it elsewhere, but it is not required here."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000005.quest_subtitle: "[Build] [Workshop] [Route] · make a landing site usable"
quest.7A11C0DE15000005.title: "&bAERONAUT"

quest.7A11C0DE15000006.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Mirelle Voss rang the Greybridge bell once for welcome and once for alarm. Nobody had written down which was which. She asks for a signal that two sides can read the same way.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Build] [Social] [Faction] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 1 Bell for inspection; it is not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one public signal or mediation procedure.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Publish a two-state signal code (welcome and alarm) with its response, visible placement, and one recorded test.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may answer the signal; solo players sign the test with the observed result or failure."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000006.quest_subtitle: "[Build] [Social] [Faction] · make one signal legible"
quest.7A11C0DE15000006.title: "&aDIPLOMAT"

quest.7A11C0DE15000007.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Elias Rook's Greybridge relief crate held food, torches, and no label. The right supplies reached the wrong hands. He asks for a field kit that can be checked at a glance.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Build] [Logistics] [Support] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 2 Barrels for inspection; they are not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one labelled public kit.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Stock and label one field kit with an inventory list, issue rule, restock owner, and one witnessed or self-audited use.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may use the kit; solo players sign the test with the observed result or failure."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000007.quest_subtitle: "[Build] [Logistics] [Support] · stock one field kit"
quest.7A11C0DE15000007.title: "&eQUARTERMASTER"

quest.7A11C0DE15000008.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Nessa's Greybridge map showed the destination and omitted the dangerous bridge. A route is only useful when the next person can survive following it.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Route] [Exploration] [Navigation] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 1 Filled Map for inspection; it is not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one route with its hazard and result recorded.",
  "&fOutput:&7 Publish a survivable route record naming both endpoints, one hazard, one safe stop, a caretaker, and the correction tested.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may follow the route; solo players sign the test with the observed result or failure."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000008.quest_subtitle: "[Route] [Exploration] [Navigation] · publish one survivable route"
quest.7A11C0DE15000008.title: "&aPATHFINDER"

quest.7A11C0DE15000009.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Mirelle Voss remembers Greybridge's failure differently from Elias Rook, and both accounts leave out the moment the plan broke. The archive needs the gap, not a polished legend.",
  "&bSuitability:&f [Archive] [Research] [Solo-friendly]",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 1 Writable Book for inspection; it is not consumed. Demonstrate or solo-test one archive procedure.",
  "&fOutput:&7 File one archive entry naming the event, source, result, uncertainty or failure, and the next test another player should run.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may review the record; solo players sign their own record and name what failed."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000009.quest_subtitle: "[Archive] [Research] · preserve one useful failure"
quest.7A11C0DE15000009.title: "&fARCHIVIST"

quest.7A11C0DE1500000A.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f Three different crafts kept Greybridge from collapsing completely. Close the gate after any three are proven, then let the rest remain invitations rather than obligations.",
  "&fObjective:&7 Complete any 3 of the 8 specialties, then review what the settlement can now do.",
  "&fStandard:&7 A solo player may document the review; a team may have another player verify it."
]
quest.7A11C0DE1500000A.quest_subtitle: "Any three specialties unlock the handoff"
quest.7A11C0DE1500000A.title: "&6&lTHREE HANDS"

quest.7A11C0DE15000101.quest_desc: [
  "&6Lore:&f A craft becomes communal only when its next operator can find the instructions and the first honest failure. Leave one key in the settlement after the three-hands review.",
  "&fObjective:&7 Carry 1 Writable Book for inspection; it is not consumed. Leave the method, its result, and one failure or maintenance warning in the settlement.",
  "&fStandard:&7 Another player may sign the handoff; solo players sign it themselves and name the next test."
]
quest.7A11C0DE15000101.quest_subtitle: "Post-capstone handoff · leave one method ready"
quest.7A11C0DE15000101.title: "&fPASS THE KEY"

reward.7A11C0DE15210001.title: "Choose an Engineer Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210002.title: "Choose an Arcanist Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210003.title: "Choose a Quartermaster Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210004.title: "Choose a Pathfinder Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210005.title: "Choose an Archivist Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210006.title: "Choose a Night Specialist Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210007.title: "Choose an Aeronaut Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210008.title: "Choose a Diplomat Supply"
reward.7A11C0DE15210101.title: "Choose a Handoff Supply"

